      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what's being tested.Now I have a clear picture of the original test. Let me write an improved version with better understandability.\n\nKey improvements I'll make:\n1. Replace the mutable shared builder (mutation across cases is hard to track) with a `baseBuilder()` factory and fluent chaining per case\n2. Switch from `ArrayList` + `.stream()` to `Stream.of(...)` — more idiomatic\n3. Add class-level Javadoc summarizing the four tested scenarios\n4. Add inline section comments that are more precise (e.g., \"maxWidth(5) < text length(11)\")\n5. Remove the unused `assertTrue` importNow I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored `TextStyleTest_testPad.java` is ready."
    }
